        <span class="section-tag rv">How We Work</span>
        <h2 id="process-title" class="rv">A Calm Routine, Every Time</h2>
        <p class="section-lead rv">Consistency builds trust. Here's what to expect from first message to wagging tail.</p>
      </header>
      <div class="process-steps" role="list">
        <article class="process-step rv" role="listitem">
          <span class="process-num">01</span>
          <h3>Meet & Plan</h3>
          <p>We chat about your pet's routine, quirks, and needs. You get a clear plan and price before anything starts.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="process-step rv" role="listitem">
          <span class="process-num">02</span>
          <h3>Settle In</h3>
          <p>First visits are unhurried. We follow your pet's lead - treats, slow introductions, and plenty of patience.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="process-step rv" role="listitem">
          <span class="process-num">03</span>
          <h3>Ongoing Care</h3>
          <p>Regular updates, photos, and a consistent carer. Adjustments anytime - just let us know.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
